\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327893\n", "files": ["xpcom/io/nsStorageStream.cpp"], "git_node": "d188434fd3db2e9774e26c1f9fda6f8cc3e94e8b", "git_parents": ["be6a0aa07c8e5c5abe5fba86ecbadd15aaf0ecdc"], "node": "faa2a554305ae89fc201e268577e40f17fc2af53", "parents": ["f30a991b20f7da54ab76ada3284589307ee7e7bd"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790068739, "git_changesets": ["d188434fd3db2e9774e26c1f9fda6f8cc3e94e8b"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "28634": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2071446 - Fix test failure in browser_localSearchShortcuts_xul.js caused when too many search engines are listed.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327419\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328062\n", "files": ["browser/components/preferences/tests/search/browser_localSearchShortcuts_xul.js"], "git_node": "9413d2d0f2c18432cbd6c27c2197e3c6104c273f", "git_parents": ["d188434fd3db2e9774e26c1f9fda6f8cc3e94e8b"], "node": "c209dff05800360f2fbdc8f649491c3f10ee94f1", "parents": ["faa2a554305ae89fc201e268577e40f17fc2af53"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790068842, "git_changesets": ["9413d2d0f2c18432cbd6c27c2197e3c6104c273f"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "28635": {"changesets": [{"author": "Florian Zia \u003cfzia@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064643 - Ensure context chip label text is centered vertically  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D325904\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328077\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-website-chip/ai-website-chip.css"], "git_node": "7bbde5d25ec8667d5fc91e267c7aa9c06267b346", "git_parents": ["9413d2d0f2c18432cbd6c27c2197e3c6104c273f"], "node": "a710057eac3ca8efc6f783985e8469965ae35210", "parents": ["c209dff05800360f2fbdc8f649491c3f10ee94f1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790068895, "git_changesets": ["7bbde5d25ec8667d5fc91e267c7aa9c06267b346"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "28636": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074002 - Dirty frames after measuring reflows for intrinsic sizing.  a=pascalc\n\nWhat's going on is:\n\n 1. Row sizing of the outer grid needs the block-size contribution of\n    .wrapper, so it does a grid MeasuringReflow of .wrapper. That\n    reflows the whole subtree, so far so good.\n\n 2. The outer grid then reflows .wrapper for real in ReflowInFlowChild.\n    Just constructing that ReflowInput runs nsIFrame::ComputeSize with\n    IApplyAutoMinSize. That goes into intrinsic size computation of\n    the block and eventually of the nested grid, which ends up calling\n    MeasuringReflow on the input with a small column size, leaving it\n    with a 0 content box size and with the dirty bits cleared.\n\n 3. When we actually reflow the block, the block doesn't reflow the\n    input, because it's not dirty, and the block has already been\n    reflowed with the right size.\n\nSo we do need to make sure that the final block reflow ends up reflowing\nthe nested grid again, unfortunately.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327979\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328079\n", "files": ["layout/generic/nsGridContainerFrame.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-grid/alignment/grid-align-baseline-nested-intrinsic-sizing-001.html"], "git_node": "3092f5c4a036730f6d659c46e113fd8895092e7e", "git_parents": ["7bbde5d25ec8667d5fc91e267c7aa9c06267b346"], "node": "b27adf141fd37257cdaa13c6539f666ba977b697", "parents": ["a710057eac3ca8efc6f783985e8469965ae35210"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790070692, "git_changesets": ["3092f5c4a036730f6d659c46e113fd8895092e7e"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "28637": {"changesets": [{"author": "Vincent Tunru \u003cvtunru@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070204 - Don't add tracker count when disabled.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326421\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327792\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-trustPanel.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser-trustPanel/browser_trust_panel_icon.js"], "git_node": "22bb3ddee5d638ddab26b56219a77bf8ab123d45", "git_parents": ["3092f5c4a036730f6d659c46e113fd8895092e7e"], "node": "9b2f07dd569ab4abc2ed964e090a600223020d03", "parents": ["b27adf141fd37257cdaa13c6539f666ba977b697"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790073796, "git_changesets": ["22bb3ddee5d638ddab26b56219a77bf8ab123d45"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "28638": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 6f2c158dfc7e9693f880fad2510ceb51a158c069 with FIREFOX-ANDROID_156_0_1_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "6836d957083f3d39b9ad05cf4440ffbd6746fd17", "git_parents": ["8f1b3668151b6badbcb850560515decf44b5a112"], "node": "01ec64c888dab6fb4723c1010ddef5133d7038db", "parents": ["66b3ff5f9c19b465c7cd3aff31332d4d38c90b26"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790081446, "git_changesets": ["6836d957083f3d39b9ad05cf4440ffbd6746fd17"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "28639": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 6f2c158dfc7e9693f880fad2510ceb51a158c069 with FIREFOX_156_0_1_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "6860693b6fe005331d8a5d0880ed9981ffde65b3", "git_parents": ["6836d957083f3d39b9ad05cf4440ffbd6746fd17"], "node": "2981cf3b1d3f5ff2fa940554e0faea2d2db15073", "parents": ["01ec64c888dab6fb4723c1010ddef5133d7038db"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790081484, "git_changesets": ["6860693b6fe005331d8a5d0880ed9981ffde65b3"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "28640": {"changesets": [{"author": "Magnus Melin \u003cmkmelin+mozilla@iki.fi\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070410 - Disable pdf.js selection rendering in Thunderbird.  a=pascalc DONTBUILD\n\nThis is a mitigation, not the fix. The underlying WebRender defect is bug\n2070962: a backdrop-filter in the root pipeline is silently dropped when an\niframe precedes it in the display list, which is what the pdf.js page canvas\ndoes. Remove this override once that is fixed.\n\nNote that the override has to live here rather than in Thunderbird's own\nall-thunderbird.js: both files ship through JS_PREFERENCE_PP_FILES into\ndefaults/pref/, which is loaded in descending filename order, so\nPdfJsDefaultPrefs.js is read last and clobbers anything all-thunderbird.js\nsets. PdfJsOverridePrefs.js is #included at the end of PdfJsDefaultPrefs.js,\nwhich is why it wins.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D326889\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328123\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pdfjs/PdfJsOverridePrefs.js"], "git_node": "3eeb47b21494b826376fa7685c59490075245626", "git_parents": ["22bb3ddee5d638ddab26b56219a77bf8ab123d45"], "node": "fc41a384d50cf5f094c5860d3751ddf22c347874", "parents": ["9b2f07dd569ab4abc2ed964e090a600223020d03"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790092569, "git_changesets": ["3eeb47b21494b826376fa7685c59490075245626"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "28641": {"changesets": [{"author": "kycn \u003c35106533+kycn@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072086 - Harden ApplicationExitInfo callers against OEM AMS throwing IllegalArgumentException.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327171\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D328215\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/perf/ApplicationExitInfoMetrics.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/telemetry/TelemetryMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/perf/ApplicationExitInfoMetricsTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/telemetry/TelemetryMiddlewareTest.kt"], "git_node": "90f01b7f68ac2c5eb6c06acc16f9327488b2b4e4", "git_parents": ["3eeb47b21494b826376fa7685c59490075245626"], "node": "8d7b5ee917c9c7724f7f2e632a7cfd1c0805a067", "parents": ["fc41a384d50cf5f094c5860d3751ddf22c347874"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790103171, "git_changesets": ["90f01b7f68ac2c5eb6c06acc16f9327488b2b4e4"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "28642": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging bd396a1cf6b78bbba84520688be5dc9118e6bf4f with FIREFOX_140_17_0esr_BUILD1 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "fc516d2117d8313e2df4f42bea71cbfd6edce8bf", "git_parents": ["6860693b6fe005331d8a5d0880ed9981ffde65b3"], "node": "189a085df1ff5b0d041f77a584eb9f1f7136044f", "parents": ["2981cf3b1d3f5ff2fa940554e0faea2d2db15073"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790104736, "git_changesets": ["fc516d2117d8313e2df4f42bea71cbfd6edce8bf"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "28643": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging f5bb60e996cf17c98a91164bc787d32566f036b5 with FIREFOX_153_4_0esr_BUILD1 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "158e5076b88609556edd6cbe5580a1d3062d7b01", "git_parents": ["fc516d2117d8313e2df4f42bea71cbfd6edce8bf"], "node": "c852acf37d964d2bd28a222fbb9982ed0c600649", "parents": ["189a085df1ff5b0d041f77a584eb9f1f7136044f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1790105285, "git_changesets": ["158e5076b88609556edd6cbe5580a1d3062d7b01"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "28644": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-beta repo-update remote-settings tld-suffixes mobile-merino-manifest ct-logs - 